From: Michael Zhang <mail@mzhang.io>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 17:51:42 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] feat(compiler): expose bundle export in the node compiler

Adds NodeCompiler.bundle(), which compiles the project for Typst's bundle
target (multiple documents and assets from one project, via `document`
and `asset`) and returns the exported files.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
